  3.783946092017396*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"53f2aa98-937e-4c9a-8f6a-\
2a72088ec3ac"],

Cell["\<\
As an example lets start by generating an impulse response function, \
h(\[Tau]), (to model the linear dynamic element) and lets make the nonlinear \
static element, n(\[CenterDot]), a cuber.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.783946101397366*^9, 
  3.783946249493556*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1cd46451-a0cc-4d48-9ecd-\
ad58f7d33556"]
}, Open  ]],

