Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Conclusion", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7840354531093245`*^9, 3.7840355424065657`*^9}, {
  3.7840363404367247`*^9, 3.784036383543155*^9}, {3.7840365500870476`*^9, 
  3.784036570988723*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d3b1a81a-4a11-42dc-b474-\
1d8751151f9b"],

Cell["\<\
In conclusion we have managed to identify both the linear dynamic part and \
the static nonlinear part of the the Wiener system. 
The Wiener system has been identified both non-parametrically as well as \
parametrically!!

\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7840354531093245`*^9, 3.7840355424065657`*^9}, {
  3.7840363404367247`*^9, 3.784036383543155*^9}, {3.7840365500870476`*^9, 
  3.784036591839425*^9}, {3.78441435535783*^9, 
  3.7844143693809543`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9b43ad4a-5596-4938-a3b1-\
bdc9b7d38fd7"],

